# Notion Integration
# 1. Go to https://www.notion.so/my-integrations and create a new integration
# 2. Copy the "Internal Integration Secret" below
NOTION_API_KEY=ntn_wR2065593632gpElOatPzGbq3JibP14qXg9eos2fa742GJ

# 3. Create a Notion database for your projects with these properties:
#    - Title (title) - project name
#    - Slug (rich_text) - URL-friendly name e.g. "saving-receipts"
#    - Description (rich_text) - short summary shown on the landing page
#    - Cover (files) - cover image for the project card
#    - Color (select) - accent color for the card (e.g. "green", "blue", "yellow", "red")
#    - Published (checkbox) - only published projects appear on the site
#    - Order (number) - display order on the landing page
# 4. Share the database with your integration (click Share > Invite)
# 5. Copy the database ID from the URL:
#    https://www.notion.so/YOUR_WORKSPACE/<DATABASE_ID>?v=...
NOTION_PROJECTS_DATABASE_ID=32500c4fd88380238c95ed01f80bd9d3

# Optional: Your profile info (or hardcode it in src/lib/profile.ts)
NEXT_PUBLIC_PROFILE_NAME="Xavier Puig"
